/// Dynamic RLS (decision D3): a member sees only the states mapped to them in security_user_state.
/// dim_region[state_code] is on every region row, so this one filter reaches every fact. National rows
/// (AUS) are never mapped, so state users don't see them. No mapping row = no data (deny by default).
/// Workspace Admin/Member/Contributor bypass RLS: state users get Read on the model only.
/// Members are not part of the model definition (the service drops them on import): the group
/// sg-care-insights-state-users is added to this role once in the service (Security), see BUILD-GUIDE 5.5.
/// security_user_state is filtered to the user's own rows, so nobody sees who else has access.
role 'State access'
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission dim_region =
			VAR _states =
				CALCULATETABLE (
					VALUES ( security_user_state[state_code] ),
					security_user_state[user_principal_name] = USERPRINCIPALNAME ()
				)
			RETURN
				dim_region[state_code] IN _states

	tablePermission security_user_state = security_user_state[user_principal_name] = USERPRINCIPALNAME ()

